  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8917e7e4a037fb946fafa0b16de664d6f0ce32ab76e5c2c9b848dc1f771a7f81.png] \n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\nA means - , B means +, C means ÷\n\n20 A 25 B 70 C 7 = 5\n\n⇒ 20 - 25 + __**70 ÷ 7**__\n\n⇒ __**20 - 25 + 10**__⇒ 5\n\n30 A 40 B 75 C 15 = -5,\n\n⇒ 30 - 40 + __**75 **____**÷ __15**\n\n⇒ __**30 - 40 + 5**__ = -5\n\nThen 4 A 10 B 8 C 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 4 - 10 + __**8 ÷ 2**__\n\n**⇒ 4 - 10 + 4 = -2**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"-2\".**",
